                "text": "Today, I am proud to introduce a House companion bill along with my colleague @RepAuchincloss aimed at breaking the monopoly PBMs hold on pharmacies across the nation.\n\nThe Patients Before Monopolies (PBM) Act would prohibit PBMs and health insurers from owning a pharmacy business, effectively ending their cartel over the drug delivery chain.",
