                "text": "Vertical integration is just a way for PBMs to corner the healthcare market and monopolize competition. I\u2019ve introduced bipartisan legislation, the Patients Before Monopolies Act, which will create a more transparent system and put patients first.\u00a0\n\nPatients love this legislation, but the PBMs don\u2019t. That tells you all you need to know.",
